@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Kiem tra may chu -> 200
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Danh sach bai tap -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 3. Chi tiet bai tap 1 -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/1

### 4. Bai tap khong ton tai -> 404 ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/999

### 5. Nop bai cho bai tap 1 -> 201 Created + Location
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentCode": "SV001", "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/rest-api" }

### 6. Doc lai luot nop vua tao (lay id tu phan hoi 5) -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 7. Nop bai thieu du lieu -> 400 INVALID_SUBMISSION
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentCode": "", "repositoryUrl": "" }

### 8. Nop vao bai tap khong ton tai -> 404 ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/999/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentCode": "SV001", "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/rest-api" }

### 9. Nop vao bai tap da dong -> 400 ASSIGNMENT_CLOSED
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/3/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentCode": "SV001", "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/rest-api" }

### 10. Luot nop khong ton tai -> 404 SUBMISSION_NOT_FOUND
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 11. Thieu Content-Type -> 415
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions

{ "studentCode": "SV001", "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001" }

### 12. JSON sai cu phap -> 400
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentCode": "SV001",

### 13. Thieu repositoryUrl -> 400
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentCode": "SV001" }

### 14. PUT khong ho tro -> 405
PUT {{api}}/api/assignments/1
Content-Type: application/json

{}